IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROGRAM-C.
* Calculates payment totals and writes the daily payment report.
* BUSINESS RULE: Payment amount must be greater than zero.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT PAYMENT-REPORT ASSIGN TO 'PAYMENT-REPORT'.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD PAYMENT-REPORT.
01 PAYMENT-REPORT-RECORD PIC X(120).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN OUTPUT PAYMENT-REPORT.
    WRITE PAYMENT-REPORT-RECORD.
    CLOSE PAYMENT-REPORT.
    STOP RUN.
